/* WiFi 版固件升级：与配网状态页同一种形态，步骤圈 / 标题 / 底部按钮直接复用配网页样式 */
@import "../wifi-provision/wifi-provision.wxss";

.ota-art {
  display: block;
  width: 320rpx;
  height: 240rpx;
  margin: 40rpx auto 0;
}

.wifi-ota-page .provision-title {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 0 48rpx;
}

.ota-title-spinner {
  flex: 0 0 32rpx;
  width: 32rpx;
  height: 32rpx;
  margin-right: 16rpx;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  border: 4rpx solid rgba(255, 98, 31, 0.18);
  border-top-color: #ff621f;
  border-radius: 50%;
  animation: provisionSpin 0.8s linear infinite;
}

.wifi-ota-page .provision-hint {
  padding: 0 48rpx;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

.ota-versions {
  margin-top: 48rpx;
  padding: 0 36rpx;
}

.ota-version-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  height: 96rpx;
}

.ota-version-row + .ota-version-row {
  border-top: 1rpx solid rgba(42, 43, 43, 0.06);
}

.ota-version-row__label {
  color: #33373d;
  font-size: 28rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
}

.ota-version-row__value {
  color: #777e88;
  font-size: 28rpx;
}

/* 升级进度条（2026-11-12）：与 WiFi 投屏结果页进度条同一套颜色；下面紧跟步骤卡 */
.ota-progress {
  margin-top: 48rpx;
  padding: 28rpx 36rpx 32rpx;
}

.ota-progress + .provision-steps {
  margin-top: 24rpx;
}

.ota-progress__head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  margin-bottom: 20rpx;
}

.ota-progress__text {
  flex: 1;
  overflow: hidden;
  color: #2a2d32;
  font-size: 28rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.ota-progress__num {
  margin-left: 24rpx;
  color: #ff621f;
  font-size: 28rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.ota-progress__bar {
  height: 16rpx;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: rgba(255, 98, 31, 0.12);
  border-radius: 999rpx;
}

.ota-progress__fill {
  height: 100%;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff8338, #ff621f);
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  transition: width 0.2s linear;
}

/* 失败：文案与百分比转红，进度停在当时的位置 */
.ota-progress.is-failed .ota-progress__text,
.ota-progress.is-failed .ota-progress__num {
  color: #e5533d;
}

.ota-progress.is-failed .ota-progress__fill {
  background: #e5533d;
}

/* 优雅刷新版本简介（2026-11-13） */
.ota-intro {
  margin-top: 24rpx;
  padding: 24rpx 32rpx;
}

.ota-intro__label {
  display: block;
  color: #8b9098;
  font-size: 24rpx;
}

.ota-intro__text {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 8rpx;
  color: #2a2d32;
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 1.6;
  white-space: pre-wrap;
  word-break: break-all;
}
